cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Sada in research, please cite this repository. Sada is a fork of Vibe; please also cite the upstream project."
title: "Sada (صدى): Arabic-first, offline speech-to-text for Windows"
abstract: >-
  Sada is an Arabic-first desktop application for fully offline speech-to-text on Windows.
  It provides a right-to-left Arabic interface, Arabic transcription defaults, Arabic transcript
  normalization and Arabic PDF export, built on the Whisper engine (whisper.cpp) and a Tauri shell.
  This repository is an independent fork of Vibe v3.2.2 (MIT).
type: software
